```txt terminal name=basic-terminal
Output "/tmp/basic-terminal.gif"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme Dracula
Set Padding 32
Set Framerate 30

Type "echo '=== some terminal commands ==='"
Sleep 300ms
Enter 1
Sleep 1s
Type "uname"
Sleep 400ms
Enter 1
Sleep 3s
Type "whoami"
Sleep 400ms
Enter 1
Sleep 3s
Type "gemma4 list-engines"
Sleep 400ms
Enter 1
Sleep 30s
